RelBench provenance and project modification notice
-------------------------------------------------
The RelationalGraphSAGE harness and reference-layer layout in execution.py
adapt the configuration and execution structure of RelBench's HeteroGraphSAGE:
https://github.com/stanford-star/relbench/blob/91c1f6420a03feb61c279aaeb194d7268435f278/relbench/modeling/nn.py
RelBench contributors' work is licensed under Apache-2.0; the complete
upstream license text is retained in licenses/RelBench-APACHE-2.0.txt at the
repository root. No separate NOTICE file occurs in that inspected upstream tree.

Modified for this project: a standalone harness, explicit reference/HGAM/block
execution modes, sampled-prefix validation, preservation of temporal per-query
occurrences and empty relationships, and destination-restricted bipartite inputs
to the same existing operators. HGAM is imported from PyTorch Geometric;
GraphSAGE, HGAM and block execution are established methods.

This adjacent notice accompanies execution.py so its measured source bytes
and historical checkpoint contracts remain unchanged. Keep this notice with
copies of the associated file, and retain the root LICENSE, NOTICE and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md when distributing this project.
